{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:08 2026-07-10 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:08 2026-07-10 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:08 2026-07-10 HKT</p><p>銅鑼灣記利佐治街25號地下惠康超市，今（10日）早上7時09分，一名姓郭45歲女店員在超市工作期間，天花板突有一塊1米乘1米的石屎墮下，擊中郭的背及手部，她受傷清醒，自行報案，稍後由救護員送往律敦治醫院敷治。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ce97396391015db81991eb71f84fb661/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-10_at_08_44_12_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"墮下多塊石屎塊遺在地面。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8dcee6e21315d47caa78f6e787086126/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-10_at_08_44_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"墮下石屎約6吋乘6吋濶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb7d08f67e905894c6be0300df9886f2/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-10_at_08_44_12.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"職員用膠板圍封墮石屎範圍。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8032038abcc7904cb2fe0095be6f982b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-10_at_08_44_11_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"天花板約1米乘1米石屎墮下，露出鋼筋。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4b20ec390d0b29be3e2eb76de03f69e5/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-10_at_08_44_11.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/59d3a9a9ec73f47471afd2485b9e30ac/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-10_at_08_44_10_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"天花板墮下石屎塊露出鋼筋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c814c50a020d1c5a0e43386392869fe1/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-10_at_08_44_10.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1d98c2b9845e248a9e4acae69878f01c/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-10_at_08_44_13.jpeg\"/><p>現場所見，墮石屎範圍在擺放洗髮水、廁紙的貨架附近，已被職員圍封，地面遺下多塊石屎，部分約6吋乘6吋。據了解，事主當時正將貨品上架，其間被墮下石屎擊傷。</p><p></p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-10T01:58:10.980216+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}